### Network Endpoints
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@apiKey = 

### Get Network Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/network/status
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Get Fee Estimate
GET {{baseUrl}}/network/fee
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Get Recommended Fee
GET {{baseUrl}}/network/recommended-fee
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Get Base Fee
GET {{baseUrl}}/network/base-fee
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Get Fee Percentiles
GET {{baseUrl}}/network/fee-percentiles?days=7
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Get Ledger Stats
GET {{baseUrl}}/network/ledger-stats
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Get Ledger Timing
GET {{baseUrl}}/network/ledger-timing?days=30
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Get Protocol Version
GET {{baseUrl}}/network/protocol-version
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Get Validators
GET {{baseUrl}}/network/validators
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
